│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Inspired by the two prior seeds' heavy parameter-sharing philosophy (collective RY+ZZ+RZ  │
│                          │ achieving 20 params, and the symmetry-broken variant at 32 params), this candidate pushes │
│                          │ parameter economy further by collapsing to just 2 distinct trainable angles per block: a  │
│                          │ single shared RY "tilt" applied to all 8 qubits, and a single shared ZZ "twist" applied   │
│                          │ along a linear chain (7 edges instead of the 8-edge ring used previously). Dropping the   │
│                          │ ring-closing edge and the separate RZ layer removes one full parameter and several gates  │
│                          │ while keeping full entangling connectivity across repeated blocks (since each block's     │
│                          │ chain composes with the next). The key insight: since RZ diagonal rotations commute with  │
│                          │ the ZZ (also diagonal) and only affect relative phase before measurement in the Z-basis   │
│                          │ correlators, a separate global RZ layer contributes redundant expressivity per block when │
│                          │ many blocks are stacked — removing it should preserve accuracy while cutting total        │
│                          │ parameters from 18 (3 per block) to 12 (2 per block), for a total of 14 trainable         │
│                          │ parameters (12 circuit + gain + bias), notably below the best prior result of 20.         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.1290                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 0.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
